  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In an August 2024 X post, Douglas A. Collins used “Broken AI Candidate” as a political description of Kamala Harris. In an October 2025 official post as VA Secretary, Collins said AI is helping the Department of Veterans Affairs provide faster and more efficient services without cutting corners. During a January 2025 confirmation hearing, Collins said there will always be a person to oversee the process and that he was not willing to take AI off the table but was not willing to have AI “randomly” in situations, especially benefits. In an August 2026 reported statement, Collins said there is always a person who actually does the actual claim.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s6",
    "s4"
   ],
